{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1656", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1656/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1656/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1656/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1656", "id": 1090073328, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5A-TLw", "number": 1656, "title": "C++ No Mission Progress", "user": {"login": "talentedbrute", "id": 1585286, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODUyODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1585286?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute", "html_url": "https://github.com/talentedbrute", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2021-12-28T18:57:18Z", "updated_at": "2021-12-29T11:17:15Z", "closed_at": "2021-12-29T00:21:15Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Latest MAVSDK: 0.50.1\r\nLatest PX4 Simualtor (jMavsim): 1.12.3\r\nLatest QGroundControl: 4.2.0\r\n\r\nTrying to get the current mission item by subscribing to the mission progress, we do not get the correct position or updates.  Sometimes on startup the position will be returned at -1, when the sim gets to the first waypoint no update is received.  Attached code is a sample of the app that we are running and demonstrates the issue.  We are using this with no issues in the Python library.\r\n\r\nA side note, the mission plan was created in QGC and uploaded to the sim. When the C++ attempts to download the plan, an error is thrown by MAVSDK.  \"UNSUPPORTED mission item command (22)\"  Not sure if that has something to do with what I am seeing.  What in the plan needs to be changed to remove this error?  QGC was configured to be used against PX4, not ArduPilot.\r\n\r\n```\r\n#include <iostream>\r\n#include <cstdint>\r\n#include <thread>\r\n#include <chrono>\r\n#include <sstream>\r\n#include <iomanip>\r\n#include <chrono>\r\n#include <math.h>\r\n#include <csignal>\r\n#include <string>\r\n\r\n#include <future>\r\n\r\n#include <mavsdk/mavsdk.h>\r\n#include <mavsdk/plugins/telemetry/telemetry.h>\r\n#include <mavsdk/plugins/mission/mission.h>\r\n#include <mavsdk/plugins/action/action.h>\r\n\r\nstatic void telemetryStatus(std::shared_ptr<mavsdk::System> system, const int port);\r\n\r\nvoid signalHandler(int signum) {\r\n\tstd::cout << \"Interrupt signal (\" << signum << \") received\" << std::endl;\r\n\r\n\tstd::cout << \"---- EXITING ----\" << std::endl;\r\n\texit(signum);\r\n}\r\n\r\nint main(int argc, char* argv[]) {\r\n\ttry {\r\n\t\tif(argc < 2 ) {\r\n\t\t\tstd::cerr << \"USAGE: orb <connection URL> <MAV ID>\" << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\treturn 1;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t// Register the signal handler\r\n\t\tsignal(SIGINT, signalHandler);\r\n\r\n\t\tmavsdk::Mavsdk mavsdk;\r\n\r\n\t\tint argCtr = argc-1;\r\n\t\tint mavid = std::stoi(argv[argCtr]);\r\n\r\n\t\t// Read the connection URL parameters\r\n\t\tfor(size_t i = 1; i < (argCtr); ++i) {\r\n\t\t\tstd::cout << \"Setting up listener on: \" << argv[i] << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\tmavsdk::ConnectionResult connResult = mavsdk.add_any_connection(argv[i]);\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif(connResult != mavsdk::ConnectionResult::Success) {\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::cerr << \"Connection Error: \" << connResult << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\t\treturn -1;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tstd::atomic<size_t> numSystemsDiscovered{0};\r\n\r\n\t\tstd::cout << \"Waiting to discovery systems...\" << std::endl;\r\n\t\tmavsdk.subscribe_on_new_system([&mavsdk, &numSystemsDiscovered]() {\r\n\t\t\tconst auto systems = mavsdk.systems();\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif(systems.size() > numSystemsDiscovered) {\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::cout << \"System Discovered\" << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\t\tnumSystemsDiscovered = systems.size();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t});\r\n\r\n\t\tstd::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::seconds(2));\r\n\r\n\t\tstd::vector<std::shared_ptr<std::thread>> threads;\r\n\r\n\t\tfor (auto system : mavsdk.systems()) {\r\n\t\t\tconst int systemID = (*system.get()).get_system_id();\r\n\t\t\tstd::cout << \"System ID:\" << systemID << \" MAVID: \" << mavid << std::endl;\r\n\r\n\t\t\t//Check to see if this is the aircraft we are supposed to listen for\r\n\t\t\tif(systemID == mavid) {\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::cout << \"Starting Thread For System ID: \" << systemID << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\t\tint port = 20200 + mavid;\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tthreads.push_back(std::make_shared<std::thread>(&telemetryStatus, std::ref(system), port));\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::seconds(1));\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t// TODO\r\n\t\t\t\tauto mission = mavsdk::Mission{system};\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::atomic<bool> want_to_pause{false};\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::cout << \"Setting up Mission Listener\" << std::endl;\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tmission.subscribe_mission_progress([&want_to_pause](mavsdk::Mission::MissionProgress mission_progress) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tstd::cout << \"--->Current Mission Item: \" << mission_progress.current << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\t\t});\r\n\r\n                auto action = mavsdk::Action{system};\r\n                std::cout << \"Arming...\" << std::endl;\r\n                const mavsdk::Action::Result arm_result = action.arm();\r\n                if (arm_result != mavsdk::Action::Result::Success) {\r\n                    std::cerr << \"Arming failed: \" << arm_result;\r\n                    return 1;\r\n                }\r\n                std::cout  << \"Armed.\" << std::endl;\r\n                std::pair<mavsdk::Mission::Result, mavsdk::Mission::MissionPlan> plan = mission.download_mission();\r\n                \r\n                mavsdk::Mission::Result startMissionResult = mission.start_mission();\r\n                if(startMissionResult != mavsdk::Mission::Result::Success) {\r\n                    std::cerr << \"Unable to start mission!\" << std::endl;\r\n                    return 1;\r\n                }\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tstd::cout << \"About to join threads\" << std::endl;\r\n\t\tfor (auto& t : threads) {\r\n\t\t\tstd::cout << \"Joining Threads\" << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\tt->join();\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t} catch(const std::exception &ex) {\r\n\t\tstd::cerr << \"ERROR : \" << ex.what() << std::endl;\r\n\t\treturn -1;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\treturn 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid telemetryStatus(std::shared_ptr<mavsdk::System> system, const int port) {\r\n\r\n\ttry {\r\n\t\tauto telemetry = mavsdk::Telemetry{system};\r\n\t\tconst int systemID = (*system.get()).get_system_id();\r\n\r\n\t\tstd::cout << \"Thread started for System ID: \" << systemID << std::endl;\r\n\r\n\t\t//Check to see if we are looking at an invalid ID\r\n\t\tif (systemID == 255) {\r\n\t\t\treturn;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t// We want to listen to the position of the drone at 1 Hz.\r\n\t\tconst mavsdk::Telemetry::Result set_rate_result = telemetry.set_rate_position(1.0);\r\n\r\n\t\tif (set_rate_result != mavsdk::Telemetry::Result::Success) {\r\n\t\t\tstd::cerr << \"ERROR: Setting rate failed:\" << set_rate_result << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\t//return;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\twhile(1) {\r\n\t\t\ttry {\r\n\t\t\t\tmavsdk::Telemetry::Position position = telemetry.position();\r\n\t\t\t\tmavsdk::Telemetry::VelocityNed velocityNed = telemetry.velocity_ned();\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t//Check to make sure the location is valid\r\n\t\t\t\tif(!isnan(position.latitude_deg) && !isnan(position.longitude_deg)) {\r\n                    //Do WORK\r\n                    std::cout << \"Telem: \" << position.latitude_deg << \":\" << position.longitude_deg << std::endl; \r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::milliseconds(1000));\r\n\t\t\t} catch(const std::exception &ex) {\r\n\t\t\t\tstd::cerr << \"ERROR processing telemetry data: \" << ex.what() << std::endl;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t} catch(const std::exception &ex) {\r\n\t\tstd::cerr << \"ERROR : \" << ex.what() << std::endl;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\treturn;\r\n}\r\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "talentedbrute", "id": 1585286, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODUyODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1585286?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute", "html_url": "https://github.com/talentedbrute", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/talentedbrute/received_events", "type